print('THE PRINTS: the design %d bytes in the map (lint %s); the recon done; the exam rows %d distinct citations, %d chars read; the callees %d facts / %d fails; Q47 %s; the exam %d bytes (lint %s) — %d rows, %d in the Hebrew, %d excluded; the spec %d lines / %d effects (%s) / %d reuses / %d edges / %d parameters; %d timed steps' % (DB, MLINT, NDC, ERC, NF, NFL, PR, EB, ELINT, NR, NHEB, NEX, c['lines'], c['new_effects'], c['ops'], c['reuses'], c['edges'], c['params'], NT))
