NEWL = 'PUSHED 68191ea; 18b (the compile of 26-28, LEAN) RUN A at #225 2026-09-26 (the design in the map — one runner %s, %d lines, %d effects + %d reuses, 10 cells, the spec module; Q47 to FAIL %s; the exam %d rows); NEXT: RUN B after a compaction (the types, the runner in parts, the tape 10/10, the chain launched), then the tail' % (S.RUNNER, c['lines'], c['new_effects'], c['reuses'], PR, NR)
